      "bbox": [
        88,
        680,
        559,
        695
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "STREPSIADES",
      "text": "Heracles! What are these monsters?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 18,
      "bbox": [
        88,
        700,
        706,
        715
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "STUDENT",
      "text": "Hey you! Why are you amazed? Why did you yell again?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 19,
      "bbox": [
        192,
        719,
        527,
        734
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Are you amazed at these students?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 20,
      "bbox": [
        88,
        739,
        872,
        773
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "STR.",
      "text": "Yes, by Zeus, I am amazed. But what are these ones doing, who are looking into the ground?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 21,
      "bbox": [
        88,
        778,
        634,
        793
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "STU.",
      "text": "These are investigating subterranean phenomena.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 22,
      "bbox": [
        88,
        797,
        902,
        848
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "STR.",
      "text": "Then they are looking for truffles. Don’t worry about it any more, monsters: I know where there are some lovely big ones. But who’s this? Why is his bottom looking towards the sky?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 23,
      "bbox": [
        88,
        854,
        576,
        869
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "STU.",
      "text": "Because his bottom is studying astronomy.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 24,
      "bbox": [
        88,
        873,
        446,
        888
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "STR.",
      "text": "Look! What’s this? Tell me!",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 25,
      "bbox": [
        88,
        893,
        357,
        908
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "STU.",
      "text": "This is astronomy.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
